        "text": "Page: About Time (2013 film). Sentence: About Time is a 2013 British romantic comedy-drama film about a young man with the special ability to time travel who tries to change his past in order to improve his future.\nPage: About Time (2013 film). Sentence: The film was written and directed by Richard Curtis, and stars Domhnall Gleeson, Rachel McAdams and Bill Nighy.\nPage: Domhnall Gleeson. Sentence: Domhnall Gleeson ( ; born 12 May 1983) is an Irish actor and writer.\nPage: Domhnall Gleeson. Sentence: He received a Bachelor of Arts in Media Arts from Dublin Institute of Technology.\nPage: Vanessa Kirby. Sentence: She starred as Estella in the BBC adaptation of \"Great Expectations\" in 2011, as Joanna in Richard Curtis' romantic comedy \"About Time\" in 2013, and currently portrays Princess Margaret in Peter Morgan's Netflix series \"The Crown\", for which she has been nominated for the British Academy Television Award for Best Supporting Actress.",
